Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, libkf6config-bin, uzunyx-keys (>= 0.1.3), uzunyx-editions (>= 0.2.0)
Description: Welcome window of the Uzunyx desktop
 Opens at the first login of a new user, not in the live session: choose
 between Akane and Sora, the main shortcuts, what the search boxes can do
 (calculator, timers, commands) and the control center.
